# Deferred questions — {{FEATURE}}

Questions the implementation chain recorded instead of stopping to ask. Each one
names the assumption the chain took so work could continue. At the end of the
chain they are walked through one per reply; an answer that needs code is either
fixed then or marked `needs-finding: true`, which `/mi-continue` turns into an
`IR-NNN` finding at Resume Step 6.

